  description: "Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from
    your hand) by banishing 1 FIRE and 1 WIND monster from your GY. You can only
    use each of the following effects of \"Loud Cloud the Storm Serpent\" once per
    turn.\r\n\u25CF You can banish 1 FIRE monster from your GY, then target 1 monster
    your opponent controls; destroy that monster, and if you do, this card gains
    ATK equal to the destroyed monster's original ATK.\r\n\u25CF You can banish 1
    WIND monster from your GY, then target 1 card in your opponent's Spell & Trap
    Zone; destroy it."
